    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92706" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόπᾰλον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>club, cudgel</i>, used to beat an
			ass, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.559
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				561
			</span></i>; to walk with, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.195
			</span></i>; <i>club</i> of the Cyclops, <i><span class="en">
				9.319
			</span></i>; of Heracles, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				512
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				47
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				495
			</span></i>; <i>war-club</i> or <i>mace</i>, shod with metal, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παγχάλκεον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.575
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.5.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόπαλα ξύλων τετυλωμένα σιδήρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.63
				</span></i>
			; a hunter's <i>staff</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				6.11
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>: as votive offering, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1106.124
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πειθόλαος τὴν Πάραλον ῥ. τοῦ δήμου
					ἐκάλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1411a13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>membrum virile,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.261
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόπτρον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.4.36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυμφαία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.75
			</span></i>.</div>
